# Only package inputs and the deployment guard enter the build context.
**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!app/
!app/**
!deploy/
deploy/**
!deploy/nexus/
deploy/nexus/**
!deploy/nexus/preflight.py

# Keep runtime data excluded even if it appears inside the package tree.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.venv
**/.agents
**/.codex
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/data
**/artwork
**/cache
**/.cache
**/covers
**/backups
**/logs
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.bak
**/*.log
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.zip
